.TH SDE-POWER-MANAGER 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sde-power-manager \- SDE power management service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-power-manager
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the native SDE power management service. SDE starts it through XDG autostart. Use sde-power-preferences for settings and sde-power-statistics for history.
.PP
This is an independent native executable built from the SDE fork sources
and included in the sde package.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display the native application options.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Original upstream copyrights and licenses are preserved. Settings at the SDE
Suite page provides the source link and full installed notice.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-settings (1),
.BR sde-suite (1)
